Package: podium-gui
Version: 1.0.0-beta4
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: git, curl, ca-certificates, gnupg, lsb-release, apt-transport-https, unzip, jq, software-properties-common, build-essential, mariadb-client, p7zip-full, trash-cli, net-tools, docker.io | docker-ce, nodejs (>= 16.0.0), npm
Maintainer: Cane Bay Computers <canebaycomputers@gmail.com>
Description: Podium GUI - Professional PHP Development Platform Interface
 Podium GUI is the premium graphical interface for the Podium development
 platform. It provides an intuitive, modern desktop application for managing
 PHP projects, Docker services, and development environments.
 .
 The GUI automatically installs and manages Podium CLI as a dependency,
 providing a complete development solution with visual project management,
 real-time monitoring, and one-click operations.
 .
 Features:
  * Visual project creation and management
  * Real-time service monitoring and control
  * Modern retro synthwave interface design
  * Cross-framework support (Laravel, WordPress, PHP)
  * Integrated Docker service management
  * Team collaboration and LAN sharing
Homepage: https://podiumdev.io
